      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "After some more experimentation, the scenario that causes the disconnect has been narrowed down. You need at least 2 people and one portal with a malformed world id as described above. The process is as follows:\n\n1. Person 1 tries to enter the faulty portal & gets a 403.\n\n2. Person 2 tries to enter the faulty portal & gets a 403 - and then gets disconnected a few seconds later.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
