      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Thanks for the reproduction steps! We've changed how those are submitted, so here's what you wrote:\n\n\"\n\n1. Create a portal in Unity.\n\n2. Post a valid worldid into it & add a space afterwards.\n\n3. Upload to VRC & test the portal in-game.\n\n(Alternatively use the test world linked above.)\n\n\"",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
